 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+`coupled-status` is a read-only operator view over the native coupled-run
+manifest and durable work ledgers. The manifest remains owned by coupled-run
+orchestration, while request counts and charge defaults remain owned by the
+native `WorkBudget` ledger. The command adds no persistent state and does not
+change existing persistence. It reports finalized rows and, when present, the
+active or interrupted pending ledger. Missing pending usage is represented as
+unknown rather than zero, limits remain known, and recorded completion is not
+independent verification or promotion authorization.
